Package: ax10-svc
Version: 1.0-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Lee Chantrey <lchantrey@gmail.com>
Section: base
Priority: optional
Depends:
Description: Minimal service manager for the TP-Link Archer AX10. This box has no procd, so ax10-svc registers foreground daemons with busybox init's built-in inittab `respawn` (PID 1 supervision, ~instant restart). Other ax10-* daemon packages depend on it and call `ax10-svc add/del`. Installs /tmp/opt/ax10-svc.
